sequenceDiagram
    participant Drv as InferenceDriver
    participant Sess as InferenceSession
    participant SS as _SessionStream (gRPC)
    participant Ctx as _SessionContext
    participant Triton as Triton worker

    Drv->>Sess: infer_chunk(Request(audio, correlation_id, sentiment_id), on_frame)
    Sess->>Ctx: read motion_ctx, audio_ctx
    Sess->>SS: send_request(audio, prev_motion_feat, prev_audio_feat, ...)
    SS->>Triton: async_stream_infer (one request, streaming response)
    Note over SS,Triton: sequence_start=True only on first request<br/>of this stream's lifetime

    loop per video frame
        Triton-->>SS: InferResponse chunk (video_frames batch, motion_ctx, audio_ctx)
        SS->>SS: _dispatch_frames(video_frames)
        SS-->>Drv: on_frame(video, correlation_id)
    end

    SS->>Ctx: on_response → motion_ctx, audio_ctx updated
    SS-->>Sess: future resolves
    Sess-->>Drv: return
